#!/usr/bin/env bash
# captive-portal: sign in to a captive portal in a small window that closes once online.
#
#   captive-portal [URL]   open URL, by default http://ping.omacom.io/nm-check.txt
#
# The default is NetworkManager's plain-HTTP connectivity check, which a portal
# intercepts to show its sign-in page; the URL argument is for testing. A second
# run while one is waiting only focuses the open window. Hyprland's window rule
# floats it. See docs/agent-guide/network-profiles.md ("Captive Portals").
#
# Adapted from Omarchy's omarchy-network-captive-portal, under its license:
#
